WEBVTT

00:02:02.490 --> 00:02:06.484
--Awesome!
--That was sweet!

00:02:35.022 --> 00:02:39.369
--What the heck?!
--Whoa...!

00:02:39.393 --> 00:02:41.953
What's with that tattoo...?!

00:02:46.967 --> 00:02:52.872
"A Clash of Fists!"

00:03:01.415 --> 00:03:05.929
What in the world is that tattoo?!

00:03:05.953 --> 00:03:09.617
It's all deformed, like
a Picasso painting!

00:03:11.225 --> 00:03:14.037
--So0 the rumors were true...
--Yes.

00:03:14.061 --> 00:03:17.541
The old tattoo passed down
from one Hanayama to the next -

00:03:17.565 --> 00:03:19.624
the 'Fearless Man' tattoo!

00:03:22.269 --> 00:03:24.795
An excellent 'Fearless Man'.

00:03:31.946 --> 00:03:34.391
Good work, Tattooist.

00:03:34.415 --> 00:03:36.975
It's an amazing work of art.

00:03:38.552 --> 00:03:40.764
Your boss endured it well!

00:03:40.788 --> 00:03:46.870
--His ancestors must be proud-
--Hey, stop blubberin'.

00:03:46.894 --> 00:03:48.055
It's wrong.

00:03:49.296 --> 00:03:53.510
--This is no 'Fearless Man'.
--What are you saying, Boss?

00:03:53.534 --> 00:03:56.613
It looks fine to me...

00:03:56.637 --> 00:04:00.784
Are you saying you're
unhappy with my work?!

00:04:00.808 --> 00:04:02.152
Tattooist...

00:04:02.176 --> 00:04:08.639
I've been in this business for 40
years! Your response is intolerable!

00:04:09.416 --> 00:04:12.529
Answer me already!

00:04:12.553 --> 00:04:14.612
It's not complete yet.

00:04:15.990 --> 00:04:19.136
Are you saying I do shoddy work?!

00:04:19.160 --> 00:04:22.973
Then tell me! What would
make it complete?!

00:04:22.997 --> 00:04:26.076
Tattooist, please don't
take it so hard...

00:04:26.100 --> 00:04:28.330
You stay out of this!

00:04:30.004 --> 00:04:31.948
Where are you going?!

00:04:31.972 --> 00:04:35.318
--Boss...!
--Please wait!

00:04:35.342 --> 00:04:37.821
You, boy.

00:04:37.845 --> 00:04:43.927
Even you know I drew that on
the previous two generations!

00:04:43.951 --> 00:04:50.534
Until he apologizes, I refuse
to help any more! Never again!

00:04:50.558 --> 00:04:51.868
Tattooist...

00:04:51.892 --> 00:04:57.507
Off with you! Get going, you vagabonds!

00:04:57.531 --> 00:04:58.726
Sir!

00:04:59.667 --> 00:05:04.047
--Why are you so pale?!
--The boss... he's gone!

00:05:04.071 --> 00:05:05.081
What?!

00:05:05.105 --> 00:05:08.118
Boss! Boss!

00:05:08.142 --> 00:05:12.622
Alright. He's not back at the office.

00:05:12.646 --> 00:05:16.583
Where could he have gone,
looking like that?

00:05:17.351 --> 00:05:18.910
Boss...

00:05:25.492 --> 00:05:30.623
Showing off your fancy picture
doesn't hurt me one bit!

00:05:37.471 --> 00:05:40.202
Wow! The kid's having at it!

00:05:42.176 --> 00:05:47.257
The giant can't fight back!
He's basically a sandbag!

00:05:47.281 --> 00:05:50.460
Was the tattoo just an empty threat?!

00:05:50.484 --> 00:05:53.078
Why isn't he fighting back?

00:05:53.721 --> 00:05:55.198
Kuriyagawa-san.

00:05:55.222 --> 00:05:58.702
Do you know the origin of
the Hanayama family tattoo?

00:05:58.726 --> 00:06:00.694
Its origin?

00:06:15.676 --> 00:06:18.922
--You think you're so great!
--Why won't you die?!

00:06:18.946 --> 00:06:22.177
That's enough. He's dead.

00:06:22.983 --> 00:06:26.963
In the spring of 1616, a
wandering gambler was cut down

00:06:26.987 --> 00:06:31.835
by a group of bandits, while
carrying a temple bell on his back.

00:06:31.859 --> 00:06:34.337
He fared well.

00:06:34.361 --> 00:06:35.556
Let's go!

00:06:51.178 --> 00:06:55.425
The child inside that small
bell was none other than

00:06:55.449 --> 00:06:59.663
Yakichi, the last child
of the Hanayama clan.

00:06:59.687 --> 00:07:02.098
Mister! Mister!

00:07:02.122 --> 00:07:06.836
Because of this man who just
happened to stay for the night,

00:07:06.860 --> 00:07:10.106
the clan escaped
annihilation on that day.

00:07:10.130 --> 00:07:13.376
And so the image of this nameless
gambler was drawn on the back

00:07:13.400 --> 00:07:16.165
of the head of each generation.

00:07:17.204 --> 00:07:20.139
As the model of a true man...

00:07:29.249 --> 00:07:31.650
What's wrong?! Fight back!

00:07:36.490 --> 00:07:39.135
What? You found the boss?!

00:07:39.159 --> 00:07:40.537
Where?

00:07:40.561 --> 00:07:43.239
What? Kobe?!

00:07:43.263 --> 00:07:48.345
What's he thinking? His father's
killers own that territory!

00:07:48.369 --> 00:07:50.714
Don't tell me he's thinking of--

00:07:50.738 --> 00:07:54.651
Get everyone moving!
We're heading to Kobe!

00:07:54.675 --> 00:07:57.144
We're taking the Tomizawa Group down!

00:08:48.328 --> 00:08:50.194
Boss...!

00:08:55.602 --> 00:08:59.038
Looks better, don't you think?

00:09:01.308 --> 00:09:03.286
Boss! What did you--

00:09:03.310 --> 00:09:08.612
An uncut 'Fearless Man'
is no 'Fearless Man'.

00:09:39.580 --> 00:09:40.290
What?!

00:09:40.314 --> 00:09:43.147
--He's serious!
--No way! Is that-

00:10:04.471 --> 00:10:09.375
So that's how he ruined
Yuri-san's arm...!

00:10:17.851 --> 00:10:22.632
All ignorant gangs
unanimously fear it...!

00:10:22.656 --> 00:10:28.322
Watch closely. This is
Kaoru Hanayama, the brawler.

00:10:55.556 --> 00:10:58.067
This has turned into one nasty fight!

00:10:58.091 --> 00:11:02.005
The tattooed giant has an
unbelievably powerful grip!

00:11:02.029 --> 00:11:05.795
Does the young warrior
have any hope of winning?!

00:11:07.501 --> 00:11:11.233
Pinky works... Thumb works...

00:11:12.639 --> 00:11:15.904
Good! The nerves are still connected!

00:11:35.629 --> 00:11:37.996
--Whoa!
--Insane!

00:12:21.642 --> 00:12:23.007
He caught him!

00:12:44.331 --> 00:12:46.609
He threw him!

00:12:46.633 --> 00:12:49.812
The runt threw the giant with one arm!

00:12:49.836 --> 00:12:51.948
He threw the boss...?!

00:12:51.972 --> 00:12:54.600
What did I just do?!

00:13:17.764 --> 00:13:24.280
<i>His body is choosing the most
effective movements all by itself.</i>

00:13:24.304 --> 00:13:27.239
<i>He just may beat Hanayama!</i>

00:13:40.354 --> 00:13:43.654
--He's smiling?
--Boss...!

00:13:46.860 --> 00:13:48.658
Oow...!

00:14:00.207 --> 00:14:03.820
The giant's taking a
stance for the first time!

00:14:03.844 --> 00:14:08.839
But he's left his sides
wide open! Is this a bluff?!

00:14:11.985 --> 00:14:14.197
No, it's no bluff.

00:14:14.221 --> 00:14:18.301
You're right. Only the boss is
capable of this ultimate stance,

00:14:18.325 --> 00:14:22.091
in which his entire weight
is placed on incoming fists!

00:14:24.297 --> 00:14:29.812
--He's been cornered!
--It's all over for your boy now!

00:14:29.836 --> 00:14:35.900
He did well to come this far,
but he never had a chance.

00:14:36.076 --> 00:14:42.379
I saw him selected as the
Chosen One with my own two eyes.

00:14:43.216 --> 00:14:48.120
It happened when I took him to
a restaurant when he was 10...

00:14:56.897 --> 00:15:01.144
At first, I figured it was
just defective merchandise,

00:15:01.168 --> 00:15:04.399
but I eventually realized
that wasn't the case.

00:15:09.176 --> 00:15:11.201
His was an inexplicable room.

00:15:12.479 --> 00:15:15.358
Empty juice cans, crushed vertically.

00:15:15.382 --> 00:15:18.461
Casually-ripped magazines
all over the place.

00:15:18.485 --> 00:15:21.297
An incredibly deformed doorknob...

00:15:21.321 --> 00:15:24.767
--What the...?
--Hey, Kizaki.

00:15:24.791 --> 00:15:27.158
Cool, huh?

00:15:28.995 --> 00:15:34.710
Only someone chosen by the
gods could have such a grip!

00:15:34.734 --> 00:15:38.281
The destructive power it has
when he puts his entire weight

00:15:38.305 --> 00:15:41.673
and speed into it...!

00:16:18.411 --> 00:16:21.073
The match is over.

00:16:21.982 --> 00:16:25.441
I would hardly have
called that a match.

00:16:26.086 --> 00:16:31.400
Hanayama was bigger and five
times stronger! Maybe even more!

00:16:31.424 --> 00:16:34.370
A fight is just an exchange of damage.

00:16:34.394 --> 00:16:37.159
Sheer strength decides it in the end!

00:16:37.998 --> 00:16:41.024
That was an excellent fight, Boss!

00:16:53.847 --> 00:16:57.408
Hanayama!

00:17:01.788 --> 00:17:06.385
We're not done yet! Get back here!

00:17:08.962 --> 00:17:11.659
Please stop!

00:17:33.853 --> 00:17:37.300
Even if your fists are made of steel,

00:17:37.324 --> 00:17:41.192
I can still smash individual
fingers with my fist!

00:17:42.495 --> 00:17:48.277
--He aimed for just his pinky...?!
--What impressive kinetic vision!

00:17:48.301 --> 00:17:50.947
Now Hanayama can't make a fist!

00:17:50.971 --> 00:17:52.496
Boss!

00:18:02.682 --> 00:18:05.379
What? With that fist of his?!

00:18:15.895 --> 00:18:17.522
Boss!

00:18:27.040 --> 00:18:28.951
It"ll be the same every time!

00:18:28.975 --> 00:18:31.069
Boss! Stop!

00:18:35.749 --> 00:18:37.148
A feint?!

00:18:41.988 --> 00:18:45.434
--His broken left elbow...!
--Boss!

00:18:45.458 --> 00:18:47.017
I win!

00:19:06.713 --> 00:19:08.357
Just made it.

00:19:08.381 --> 00:19:12.375
The last bullet in the
weapons depot decided it.

00:19:13.687 --> 00:19:20.169
But to think a mere 13-year-old
could drive the boss this far...

00:19:20.193 --> 00:19:24.289
There's no doubt he has no ammo left...

00:19:33.139 --> 00:19:36.819
This is lkebukuro, Captain Strydom.

00:19:36.843 --> 00:19:42.976
--Get us above the Fukuroh Building.
--But we can't land here...

00:19:45.318 --> 00:19:47.343
I don't care. Just go.

00:20:15.348 --> 00:20:17.373
Master Baki!

00:20:35.935 --> 00:20:38.870
--Glass?
--In his mouth...?

00:20:39.739 --> 00:20:44.754
I put a piece in my cheek when
I went through the window.

00:20:44.778 --> 00:20:46.722
Thought it might keep me conscious

00:20:46.746 --> 00:20:50.114
if you gave me a good one to the face.

00:20:51.818 --> 00:20:56.665
He planned that far in
advance? Incredible...

00:20:56.689 --> 00:21:00.002
You... win...

00:21:00.026 --> 00:21:03.506
Had this been a match,
you would've won.

00:21:03.530 --> 00:21:08.468
Winning a match means
nothing to a brawler.

00:21:09.769 --> 00:21:13.672
That was a great fight!

00:21:43.136 --> 00:21:44.467
Madam?

00:21:47.540 --> 00:21:51.477
He's coming...!

00:21:58.551 --> 00:22:02.112
We're here, Yujiro.

00:22:44.397 --> 00:22:49.945
The hazy afternoon in the winter sun

00:22:49.969 --> 00:22:55.551
<i>hangs onto love in one
corner of the pavement</i>

00:22:55.575 --> 00:23:01.223
When I blew on my cold hands

00:23:01.247 --> 00:23:06.228
a tiny bit of courage swelled up.

00:23:06.252 --> 00:23:11.767
Today will certainly be wonderful,

00:23:11.791 --> 00:23:17.306
<i>gently enveloped in love</i>

00:23:17.330 --> 00:23:22.978
There are some strange feelings too,

00:23:23.002 --> 00:23:28.517
but they will be reborn

00:23:28.541 --> 00:23:34.189
Today will certainly be wonderful;

00:23:34.213 --> 00:23:39.583
they will be reborn as even more love.

00:23:49.629 --> 00:23:51.563
"Next Episode™

00:23:53.166 --> 00:23:58.627
The man took that one step as
if going down his own stairs.

00:23:59.572 --> 00:24:06.000
A demon from the realm of gods -
the strongest being in the world.

00:24:06.579 --> 00:24:11.827
The woman encounters him
in a perilous meeting.

00:24:11.851 --> 00:24:14.563
The wheels of fate begin to turn.

00:24:14.587 --> 00:24:19.388
"Next Episode: Demon™
